### Page 6 of 22

```text
UDC-23-00016

February 6, 2023

BACKGROUND:
This zoning map amendment is City-initiated in conjunction with a City-initiated annexation und Wyo. Stat. §
15-1-404.   City zoning districts are established in conjunction with annexation typically to support a proposed
development.  Because this is a City-initiated annexation staff has evaluated the development pattern of the
area, sought input from landowners, and utilized PlanCheyenne’s Future Land Use Plan to determine an
appropriate zoning district for the area.

This application proposes to change the zoning from County Mixed Use (MU) zoning district to City
Community Business (CB) zoning district.  The properties are currently developed in various manners
including residential, outdoor storage, and retail and the lot on the southwest corner of Cheyenne Street and
Wills Road is vacant.  The proposed Community Business (CB) zoning allows variety of commercial uses.

